From 76bdfd7c4faae0b4d7d79ee65967f1cccf2c6eb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: backslashxx <118538522+backslashxx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Feb 2026 10:56:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "mm: protect VMA modifications using VMA sequence
 count"

This reverts commit dd2b4655c6cd361db3e3816a4929c94b1cd994d0.
---
 fs/proc/task_mmu.c |  5 +----
 fs/userfaultfd.c   | 32 ++++++++++++-----------------
